<title>HONG KONG: Chung Hwa rises on spin-off hopes.</title>
<headline>Chung Hwa rises on spin-off hopes.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of packager Chung Hwa Development Holdings Ltd rose on Friday after the company said it was still in discussions on a proposed public offering of a subsidiary in the United States, brokers said.</p>
<p>The shares rose HK$0.04, or 3.08 percent, to HK$1.34.</p>
<p>&quot;Hopes of an exceptional gain from the spin-off fuelled speculative interest,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>But brokers expected limited upside unless there was solid progress in the spin-off talks. Chung Hwa said discussions were at a preliminary stage and terms had not been finalised.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
